        "heading": "From the doorstep to the resident",
        "accent": "cyan",
        "text": [
          "A fictional doorbell design, organized by domain. Follow an event from Doorbell through Connectivity and Recording to Apps / Notify. Open a domain to see its handoffs; use Recording to expand its internals in context. Each orange or purple path is an authored outcome, with no automatic retry or recovery."
        ],
